<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian unemployment rises in February.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian unemployment rises in February.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's February unemployment edged up to 6.3 percent versus 6.2 in January, the labour exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> LITHUANIAN UNEMPLOYMENT  Feb '97     Jan '97	   Feb '96</p>
<p> Unemployment rate	  6.3	   6.2		 8.2</p>
<p> Number of unemployed     110,951     109,851	   142,348</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom - 370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
